%% PROPOSED client widget lifecycle (no server authority)
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> ABSENT: assistant_enabled false
  [*] --> CLOSED: assistant_enabled true
  CLOSED --> OPENING: click or Ctrl+K
  OPENING --> OPEN_IDLE: DOM built, sync
  OPEN_IDLE --> OPEN_BUSY: send, confirm or transcribe
  OPEN_BUSY --> OPEN_IDLE: response
  OPEN_IDLE --> CLOSED: Esc or close
  OPEN_BUSY --> CLOSED: close; server run continues, launcher shows busy ring
